    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Макс, нам надо серьёзно поговорить!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max, we need to talk seriously!' Victoria approaches him with an important purpose.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Привет, Вика! Рад тебя видеть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, Vika! Glad to see you.' Max replies nervously while searching for an escape.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ой, Костя звонит, извини!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, Kostya is calling, sorry!' Max leads with the direct command form meaning 'sorry', pairing it with 'oh' and 'is calling'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Алло, Костя, говори громче!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Kostya, speak louder!' Max fakes a noisy conversation into his device.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Плохо слышно, я сейчас подойду!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hard to hear, I will come over right now!' Max puts the word for 'poorly' together with 'audible' and 'right now' in a crisp, natural spoken turn of phrase.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Макс, подожди, не уходи!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max, wait, do not leave!' Victoria tries to stop him from slipping away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вика, это очень срочное дело!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vika, this is a very urgent matter!' Max insists with dramatic urgency before rushing off.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя, а ты чего звонил?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, why did you call?' Max whispers hurriedly as he reaches the bar.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "В смысле, я тебе не звонил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean, I did not call you.' Kostya puts the word for 'sense' together with 'called' in a crisp, natural spoken turn of phrase.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сделай вид, что нужна помощь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pretend that you need help!' Max leads with the direct command form meaning 'make', pairing it with 'appearance' and 'needed'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А, ты прячешься от Вики?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, you are hiding from Vika?' Kostya quickly figures out his friend's motive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, подыграй мне, пожалуйста!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, play along with me, please!' Max leads with the direct command form meaning 'play along' to make the point directly in conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ну давай, пошли на склад.",
